# Nature Portfolio Figs. 5-7, Methods (Figs. 4-7) & SuppFigs 14-23 release (2026-11-22):
# Whitelist curated outputs, source-data CSVs, Excel workbook, Word/Markdown manuscript, and figures.
!/*.docx
!/*.xlsx
!/*.json
!/*.md
!code/*.py
!figures/*.png
!figures/*.pdf
!figures/*.svg
!data/*.csv

# Exclude binary caches and Python bytecode
*.pkl
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
